   "statement": "lemma Data.short_forms : ∃ q > (0 : ℚ), ∃ B, B = (q : ℂ) • D.projectedPoincare ∧ (∃ S ⊆\n  D.integralRamified, span ℂ S = ⊤ ∧ ∀ φ ∈ S, ∀ s σ, (D.Θ 1 (B s φ)).normSqAt σ ≤ exp (D.mainHeight\n  - D.m * D.remainder + D.logB * D.budget)) ∧ ∀ (t : Finset D.G) n (y : Fin n → _), (∀ i, y i ∈\n  Set.image2 (B ·) t D.integralRamified) → D.IndexLe y (#t * finrank ℂ D.Column * D.budget)",
