   "statement": "lemma Data.exists_family_covolumeSq_le (D : Data P) : ∃ n, ∃ y : Fin n → _, LinearIndependent ℂ y ∧\n    (1 - 4 / D.b ^ 2) * D.rowDim ≤ n ∧\n  (∃ δ ≤ 5 * D.rowDim * log (1 + D.b ^ 2) * D.budget, D.IndexLe y δ) ∧ ∀ σ,\n  covolumeSq (D.Θ 1 ∘ y) σ ≤ exp (n * (D.mainHeight - D.m * D.remainder + D.logB * D.budget))",
